# ---- robot runtime state -------------------------------------------------
# The motor calibration belongs to ONE physical robot and must never be shared
# between machines via git -- pulling someone else's zeros onto this robot would
# be actively dangerous. It normally lives in ~/.config/humanoid_robot/, well
# outside the repo; these patterns are a backstop in case anyone points
# `calibrate --store` at the working tree.
calibration.yaml
*.calib.yaml

